  "title": "Apple-Marzipan Muffins",
  "description": "If you like marzipan, try these delicious apple muffins for the holidays. They are easy to make and freeze well, too.",
  "authors": [
    "barbara"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-11-03T02:06:17-05:00",
